      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I have more to add to this talk of feedback, but since this is a closed issue, I've made a new canny under the feedback tab.\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/avatar-30/p/feedback-allow-integer-based-puppet-menus\nRegardless, thank you for your response.",
