  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-25T02:22:59.531Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When holding down a button in a menu, the parameter automatically resets after about a second, even if it's still being held.\nThis prevents any animators that relied on holding the button for a duration, or to consistently change avatar states for the duration of the press.\nIn this video link, all 3 attempts at using the button are attempting to hold it down.\n(You can tell when I actually release the button based on the sound effect that plays)\nhttps://youtu.be/ye3_ffOOBVE",
